Z||000000||firstfiero||01-18-2001||11:29 AM||||       I usually only race ricers. They really get under my skin but last night on my way home I'm driving the speed limit and so is the guy in the lane next to me he was also about 2 car lengths ahead. Well I see headlights in my eyes and realize that a guy in a new blazer is hamering up behind him doing about twice the speed limit and is going to do the old cut me off quickly to go around this other driver. So as his front end got to my door the *******  in my took over and I popped 2nd and hammered it. he also hammered to not let me close the gap but all that did was cause him to almost hit that poor guy in the other lane so he pulled behind me and put his high beams in my eyes. I guess he was mad because I didn't let him cut me off. So when we stop at the next light he pulls up beside me and starts revving his engine. I realize then that he has the exact blazer I have except it sounds like he's put an exhaust package on it...blazers aren't very loud but his car had a rumble. Since I own one I know he doesn't have a prayer. Their no slow but their to heavy to be racing the fiero. Light turns green and we both hammer it...I red line it in first. already have a quarter to half car lead on him. I was going to do the same in second but shifted at 4000 grand when i realized that I had him and their was no point stressing my girls engine for nothing. I turned off at the next street. I jokingly told my wife when I got home and she told me I have anger managment problems when it comes to driving.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> All I know that some little kid in an suv are going to blast my in the 'RO!!! ||||reg||1
